/span><span begin="00:57.040" end="00:57.520">way</span><span begin="00:57.520" end="00:57.520">.</span><span begin="00:57.520" end="00:57.550">"</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.550" end="01:00.670"><span begin="00:57.550" end="00:57.790">So </span><span begin="00:57.790" end="00:57.970">if </span><span begin="00:57.970" end="00:58.180">you </span><span begin="00:58.180" end="00:58.540">don't </span><span begin="00:58.540" end="00:59.020">rate</span><span begin="00:59.020" end="00:59.020">, </span><span begin="00:59.020" end="00:59.290">just </span><span begin="00:59.290" end="01:00.580">overcompensate</span><span begin="01:00.580" end="01:00.670">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.670" end="01:05.140"><span begin="01:00.670" end="01:00.820">At </span><span begin="01:00.820" end="01:01.240">least </span><span begin="01:01.240" end="01:01.660">you'll </span><span begin="01:01.660" end="01:02.080">know </span><span begin="01:02.080" end="01:02.260">you </span><span begin="01:02.260" end="01:02.560">can </span><span begin="01:02.560" end="01:02.920">always </span><span begin="01:02.920" end="01:03.220">go </span><span begin="01:03.220" end="01:03.370">on </span><span begin="01:03.370" end="01:03.730">Ricki </span><span begin="01:03.730" end="01:04.390">lake</span><span begin="01:04.390" end="01:05.140">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.140" end="01:07.930"><span begin="01:05.140" end="01:05.410">The </span><span begin="01:05.410" end="01:05.860">world </span><span begin="01:05.860" end="01:06.220">needs </span><span begin="01:06.220" end="01:07.330">wannabe's</span><span begin="01:07.330" end="01:07.330">, </span><span begin="01:07.330" end="01:07.930">so</span><span begin="01:07.930" end="01:07.930">.</span><span begin="01:07.930" end="01:07.930">.</span><span begin="01:07.930" end="01:07.930">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.930" end="01:21.160"><span begin="01:07.930" end="01:08.320">Hey</span><span begin="01:08.320" end="01:08.38